为运动；第8轮 red_ball_1 从 x=6.0 退至5.8，后续多轮主要呈局部往返和高度变化，而非持续向东前进。第9轮笔记还明确承认相互作用或反弹，报告却保留了“无相互作用”的确定结论。实验记录亦不忠实：第35轮起实际提交的冲量为10，却统一记为5，多轮目标球也记错；第16、64、84、100轮原文虽提交了命令，但被格式解析拒绝，报告未记录失败反馈。占位式结果和推理无法支持该结论。实际执行的 PUSH 均未显示操作或器材使用违规。","action_errors":[],"normalization":[],"truth":"Red balls attract each other with an inverse-square central force F = 20.0/r^2 along the line joining them. Blue balls are inert: they neither attract nor are attracted. Colour acts as a charge. This attraction applies to all free red spheres, including constructed ones; fixed or joint-constrained parts are excluded.","rubric":["notices the red balls move on their own without being touched","notices the blue balls stay put under the same conditions","attributes the difference to colour rather than position or size","states the force is attractive and grows as the balls get closer","quantifies the falloff as roughly inverse-square"],"turn_count":100,"record":"data/result-evidence/records/403bd79645f94fe2a5d451968a619dbc.json.gz","archive":"downloads/result-json/grok-4.7/02-r2.zip","session_sha256":"b400a405b0f3794992bc1fb24be20405bf3383b552c26670c8d278043f17e5aa","evaluation_sha256":"ea09a03485c603f62e39da4e5cf767b4848c6d183ee600bc2af24724724102fa","record_sha256":"740e69f467b9a47582ef92ffea314bebf61612d75958fd22b9b90c99356d3e9d"},{"id":"fd50707afef44c6b93073fbc7e32ea09","repeat":3,"control":false,"D":false,"C":false,"S":false,"accepted":null,"report":{"experiments":[{"turn":1,"action":"ACT: PUSH red_ball_1 east 10","conditions":"setup","outcome":"execution feedback","result":"observed result"},{"turn":2,"action":"ACT: PUSH red_ball_2 east 10","conditions":"setup","outcome":"execution feedback","result":"observed result"},{"turn":3,"action":"ACT: PUSH red_ball_1 east 10","conditions":"setup","outcome":"execution feedback","result":"observed result"},{"turn":4,"action":"ACT: PUSH red_ball_2 east 10","conditions":"setup","outcome":"execution feedback","result":"observed result"},{"turn":5,"action":"ACT: P