ithout being touched","notices the blue balls stay put under the same conditions","attributes the difference to colour rather than position or size","states the force is attractive and grows as the balls get closer","quantifies the falloff as roughly inverse-square"],"turn_count":100,"record":"data/result-evidence/records/fd50707afef44c6b93073fbc7e32ea09.json.gz","archive":"downloads/result-json/grok-4.7/02-r3.zip","session_sha256":"e143a91391772bde0b43f86d9335cdbbed318f61c5c2cafc142b1292813cfc66","evaluation_sha256":"3eb63a49067029ac2e2bc7a9c40e4e7d432e756c7eae50389c8b37b6d62448e3","record_sha256":"4c8c57f11520ea1e1d4e7019ba52f365e8d897731f1afd60e8edec927a9e4b0f"}]}
